{"4739280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aislebound", "steam_appid": 4739280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aislebound</strong> is a first-person retail simulator that puts you at the forefront of all aspects of managing a retail store. Start with a small shop in your neighborhood plaza and grow into a massive mega-store!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to decide how your products are merchandised. With custom modular shelving, put your products on display any way you'd like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/0bae6af4780c37f3b65d3f2ce125a638.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/0bae6af4780c37f3b65d3f2ce125a638.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Backroom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage deliveries, and utilize multiple different tools to quickly and efficiently get your products to the shelves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/d48d927353440331b11109a149b11be2.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/d48d927353440331b11109a149b11be2.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=926 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Customer Experience!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment a customer enters your store, everything affects their experience. The easier it is to find like products, and the better the prices are, the more popular your store will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/59ce64e703e976757714f10b74d0a40f.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/59ce64e703e976757714f10b74d0a40f.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Pricing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices to whatever you'd like! Higher prices may bring in more money, but less customer interest. Lower prices may bring in lots of customers, but you may not make enough profit. Experiment with what prices give the best results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/365fa4f3ee08e43d6f44b11e644e8d1f.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/365fa4f3ee08e43d6f44b11e644e8d1f.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Brand!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store's brand to make it<strong> yours!</strong> Give it any name, logo, and appearance you'd like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/ea7c5ac00fd799746cac7af4c597ae08.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/ea7c5ac00fd799746cac7af4c597ae08.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aislebound</strong> is a first-person retail simulator that puts you at the forefront of all aspects of managing a retail store. Start with a small shop in your neighborhood plaza and grow into a massive mega-store!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to decide how your products are merchandised. With custom modular shelving, put your products on display any way you'd like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/0bae6af4780c37f3b65d3f2ce125a638.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/0bae6af4780c37f3b65d3f2ce125a638.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Backroom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage deliveries, and utilize multiple different tools to quickly and efficiently get your products to the shelves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/d48d927353440331b11109a149b11be2.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/d48d927353440331b11109a149b11be2.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=926 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Customer Experience!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment a customer enters your store, everything affects their experience. The easier it is to find like products, and the better the prices are, the more popular your store will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/59ce64e703e976757714f10b74d0a40f.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/59ce64e703e976757714f10b74d0a40f.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Pricing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices to whatever you'd like! Higher prices may bring in more money, but less customer interest. Lower prices may bring in lots of customers, but you may not make enough profit. Experiment with what prices give the best results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/365fa4f3ee08e43d6f44b11e644e8d1f.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/365fa4f3ee08e43d6f44b11e644e8d1f.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Own Your Brand!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store's brand to make it<strong> yours!</strong> Give it any name, logo, and appearance you'd like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras/ea7c5ac00fd799746cac7af4c597ae08.avif?t=1782786778\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/extras_big/ea7c5ac00fd799746cac7af4c597ae08.webp?t=1782786778 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Aislebound is a first-person retail management simulator. Start with a small empty store and build it into a thriving retail operation by ordering inventory, stocking shelves, managing deliveries, hiring staff, and keeping customers satisfied.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/ed88b72a130666aae650ca38b25a36e47376e020/header.jpg?t=1782786778", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739280/dc085de6f0bfd551cbfa08de0